bug_descriptions |bug_id, line_num, content|
    text_index_char_compiler_codegen_switch_held_2026-11-03, 1100, "2026-11-06 p1-sweep: hold re-checked, phase-3 acceptance still unmet (multi-module builds fail at s3_fable50); hold kept, no change"
    text_index_char_compiler_codegen_switch_held_2026-11-03, 976, "2026-11-05 p1-common premise check: HOLD STILL VALID, no code change. Bootstrap phase 3 has not passed (stage3 build drvfix3 still running; phase-3-first policy), and this switch changes text[i] semantics in the compiler that stage2 uses to compile its own lexer, so landing it now risks the phase-3 build. Prereq census at origin/release/1.0.0: src/compiler/10.frontend already uses byte_at/char_code_at at 47 sites and has 0 direct source[i]/src[i] indexing sites matched. Resume after stage3 links and passes MCP/caret/dev-hub acceptance; repro spec test/01_unit/language/text_index_ruby_semantics_spec.spl."
    text_index_char_compiler_codegen_switch_held_2026-11-03, 976, "2026-11-05 p1-common premise check: HOLD STILL VALID, no code change. Bootstrap phase 3 has not passed (stage3 build drvfix3 still running; phase-3-first policy), and this switch changes text[i] semantics in the compiler that stage2 uses to compile its own lexer, so landing it now risks the phase-3 build. Prereq census at origin/release/1.0.0: src/compiler/10.frontend already uses byte_at/char_code_at at 47 sites and has 0 direct source[i]/src[i] indexing sites matched. Resume after stage3 links and passes MCP/caret/dev-hub acceptance; repro spec test/01_unit/language/text_index_ruby_semantics_spec.spl."
    text_index_char_compiler_codegen_switch_held_2026-11-03, 994, "2026-11-05 p1w-tichar: HOLD KEPT after review of s3_fable43 evidence (C:/dev/p3new/s3new/fable_milestones.md 13:52-15:30). Release criterion (stage3 links AND passes phase-3 acceptance: MCP + caret suite + dev hub) is NOT met: s3_fable43 linked and gate g43b passed only c01/c03/c07/hello/variable (single-module); E-RTI-006 two-rows-for-callee-main is nondeterministic on 43 (driver route 1/2, 41b 0/1; fix #6921 not in 43, folds into leaf 45); any 2+ module batch AVs (capsule-not-found / invalid array handle; fix #6919 not in 43, leaf 46); F3 test runner on 44 AVs at native_trait_owner_for_type+0x202e, so the repro spec test/01_unit/language/text_index_ruby_semantics_spec.spl cannot run on any stage3 yet. No MCP/caret/dev-hub run exists on 43/44. Switching text[i] semantics in src/compiler/50.mir now would change code the phase-3 leaves 45/46 are actively folding. Resume condition unchanged: stage3 (>=46) passes Q_hello 3/3, multi-module Q_b2/Q_leaf, F3, then MCP/caret/dev-hub."
    text_index_char_compiler_codegen_switch_held_2026-11-03, 995, "2026-11-06 p1all re-eval at s3_fable46/47b: HOLD KEPT. 46 passes Q_hello and Q_leaf only; Q_b2 and any real multi-module build fail llc use-of-undefined-value (own mqf probe on 46: all 3 modules); F3 test runner on 47b still AVs in register_native_trait_implementations (#7067/#7069 folded for leaf 48); no MCP/caret/dev-hub run exists. Phase-3 acceptance not met; resume condition unchanged."
    text_index_char_compiler_codegen_switch_held_2026-11-03, 1043, "2026-11-06 laneC-w3 re-eval at s3_fable50: HOLD KEPT. Solo gate lc3 on a copy of s3_fable50.exe (24417280 B): c01/c03/c07 PASS (native exe), variable [x] and hello [hello] match, no AV (gate_lc3.txt) - but that gate is single-module only. Release criterion (stage3 links AND passes MCP + caret suite + dev hub) still unmet: fable_milestones.md has no MCP/caret/dev-hub run on any s3_fable build; phase-4 multi-module runs on 46/48 had 0 PASS (AV classes fixed by #7168/#7166/#7170 only just folded into 50; p4f50 run only started 15:39); hello AV on 50a was intermittent (14:55 note) so stability is unproven; f3r_b array-valued struct-ctor still open on 50. Changing text[i] in MIR/codegen now would perturb the compiler stage2 uses on its own lexer mid-stabilisation. Resume when p4f50 yields multi-module PASSes and MCP/caret/dev-hub acceptance is run on a linked stage3."

